%% title: Deploy, step 3 of 3: Flux applies and Flagger switches traffic
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as Flux
    participant O as ghcr
    participant K as API server
    participant FG as Flagger
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant CI as deploy job
    F->>O: pull the prod tag, verify its signature
    F->>K: apply
    FG->>S: Release Gate webhook
    S-->>FG: promote once every member is healthy
    S-->>CI: settled: Serving or Held
